  "body": "I think it would be nice for developers to be able to select the appropriate data type on input type=file.\n\n```\n<input type=\"file\" datatype=\"stream\">\n<input type=\"file\" datatype=\"blob\"> //Current data type. Default.\n<input type=\"file\" datatype=\"buffer\">\n<input type=\"file\" datatype=\"text\">\n```\n",
